<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>62.0</apiVersion>
    <customErrors>
        <name>BlockDemoUnitSale</name>
        <label>Custom Error: Block Demo Unit Sale</label>
        <locationX>200</locationX><locationY>500</locationY>
        <customErrorMessages>
            <errorMessage>Esta unidad está designada como Demo/Exhibición y no puede venderse en la venta general (HU-046). Si necesita venderla, solicite la liberación a su gerente.</errorMessage>
            <isFieldError>false</isFieldError>
        </customErrorMessages>
    </customErrors>
    <decisions>
        <name>IsUnitBlocked</name>
        <label>Decision: Unit Designated as Demo?</label>
        <locationX>200</locationX><locationY>400</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Allow</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>UnitBlocked</name>
            <conditionLogic>1 AND (2 OR 3)</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>GetLinkedVehicle</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue><booleanValue>false</booleanValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>GetLinkedVehicle.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue><stringValue>En demostración</stringValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>GetLinkedVehicle.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue><stringValue>En exhibicion</stringValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector><targetReference>BlockDemoUnitSale</targetReference></connector>
            <label>Blocked</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>HasBypassPermission</name>
        <label>Decision: Has Bypass Permission?</label>
        <locationX>200</locationX><locationY>100</locationY>
        <defaultConnector><targetReference>IsVehicleLinkChanged</targetReference></defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Validate</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>BypassGranted</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Permission.BypassAllocationValidation</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue><booleanValue>true</booleanValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <label>Bypass (integration/admin)</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>IsVehicleLinkChanged</name>
        <label>Decision: Vehicle Link New or Changed?</label>
        <locationX>200</locationX><locationY>200</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Unchanged</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>VehicleLinkChanged</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.RecordType.DeveloperName</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue><stringValue>GQOpportunitiesAutos</stringValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Vehiculo__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue><elementReference>$Record__Prior.Vehiculo__c</elementReference></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector><targetReference>GetLinkedVehicle</targetReference></connector>
            <label>Autos sale, new or changed</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Sales guard for demo/exhibition vehicles, no Apex (HU-046, Esc.10 - visible but not sellable). All countries. Before-save on Opportunity create/update when Vehiculo__c (existing org lookup Opportunity-to-Vehicle, confirmed by describe 05/08) is set or changed: if the linked unit has Vehicle.Status = En demostración or En exhibicion, a custom error blocks the save. Replaces the earlier Quote Before Handler draft - Quote and QuoteLineItem have NO unit lookup in this org (describes 05/08), so Opportunity.Vehiculo__c is the only native anchor. Bypass via BypassAllocationValidation custom permission (grants integration/admin). Fires only for record type GQOpportunitiesAutos (vehicle SALES) and only when the link is new or changed ($Record__Prior comparison) - Vehiculo__c was created for Repuestos/PA opportunities (field description: the customer's vehicle receiving parts, populated by the vehicle search), where linking a demo unit is LEGITIMATE (e.g., accessories for a demo car), so RepuestosPA and other record types are exempt by design. Release-for-sale is unaffected: Execute Demo Request releases Vehicle.Status BEFORE creating the VIN Opportunity. TODO-DAVI: if an Opportunity before-save handler flow already exists in the org, MERGE this logic into it (one before-handler per object, per GRPQM conventions). Picklist API values verbatim from the org: En demostración (accented), En exhibicion (NOT accented).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Opportunity Before Handler {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Flow Trigger: Opportunity Before Handler</label>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetLinkedVehicle</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Linked Vehicle</label>
        <locationX>200</locationX><locationY>300</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector><targetReference>IsUnitBlocked</targetReference></connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.Vehiculo__c</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Vehicle</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <start>
        <locationX>200</locationX><locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector><targetReference>HasBypassPermission</targetReference></connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Vehiculo__c</field>
            <operator>IsNull</operator>
            <value><booleanValue>false</booleanValue></value>
        </filters>
        <object>Opportunity</object>
        <recordTriggerType>CreateAndUpdate</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordBeforeSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Draft</status>
</Flow>
